    "%lld working copies of this repository (git worktrees, such as the ones agents work in) are on this Mac. They share this one database, so a bead changed in one is changed in all." : {
      "comment" : "Count of checkouts, when there are too many to name",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Auf diesem Mac gibt es %lld Arbeitskopien dieses Repositorys (Git-Worktrees, etwa die, in denen Agenten arbeiten). Sie teilen sich diese eine Datenbank; ein in einer geänderter Bead ist also in allen geändert."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En este Mac hay %lld copias de trabajo de este repositorio (worktrees de git, como las que usan los agentes). Comparten esta única base de datos, así que un bead cambiado en una cambia en todas."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ce Mac contient %lld copies de travail de ce dépôt (worktrees git, comme ceux où travaillent les agents). Elles partagent cette seule base de données ; un bead modifié dans l'une l'est dans toutes."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "このMacには、このリポジトリの作業コピー（エージェントが作業するものなどのgitワークツリー）が%lld個あります。すべてがこの1つのデータベースを共有しているため、1つで変更したビーズはすべてで変更されます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이 Mac에는 이 저장소의 작업 사본(에이전트가 작업하는 것과 같은 git 워크트리)이 %lld개 있습니다. 모두 이 하나의 데이터베이스를 함께 쓰므로, 한 곳에서 바꾼 비즈는 모든 곳에서 바뀝니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Este Mac tem %lld cópias de trabalho deste repositório (worktrees do git, como as que os agentes usam). Elas compartilham este único banco de dados; um bead alterado em uma é alterado em todas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld working copies of this repository (git worktrees: %@) are on this Mac. They share this one database, so a bead changed in one is changed in all." : {
      "comment" : "Count of checkouts, then their branch names",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Auf diesem Mac gibt es %1$lld Arbeitskopien dieses Repositorys (Git-Worktrees: %2$@). Sie teilen sich diese eine Datenbank; ein in einer geänderter Bead ist also in allen geändert."
          }
        },
