    "The beads follow the repository to each Mac you clone it on." : {
      "comment" : "Share Beads: audience description",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Beads folgen dem Repository auf jeden Mac, auf dem du es klonst."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los beads siguen al repositorio a cada Mac en el que lo clones."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les beads suivent le dépôt sur chaque Mac où vous le clonez."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ビーズは、リポジトリをクローンした各Macに付いていきます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "비즈는 저장소를 클론하는 각 Mac으로 따라갑니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Os beads acompanham o repositório em cada Mac em que você o clonar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The beads here and the beads on %@ were started separately, so bd can't merge them. Bringing them together means choosing one and moving the other's beads into it by hand; bd's guidance is to keep the one on %@ and run bd bootstrap in a fresh clone. Beady won't pick for you." : {
      "comment" : "The remote's name, twice",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Beads hier und die Beads auf %1$@ wurden getrennt begonnen, daher kann bd sie nicht zusammenführen. Sie zusammenzubringen heißt, eines zu wählen und die Beads des anderen von Hand hineinzuübertragen; bd empfiehlt, das auf %2$@ zu behalten und in einem frischen Klon bd bootstrap auszuführen. Beady entscheidet das nicht für dich."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The beads here and the beads on %1$@ were started separately, so bd can't merge them. Bringing them together means choosing one and moving the other's beads into it by hand; bd's guidance is to keep the one on %2$@ and run bd bootstrap in a fresh clone. Beady won't pick for you."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los beads de aquí y los de %1$@ se iniciaron por separado, así que bd no puede fusionarlos. Unirlos implica elegir uno y pasar a mano los beads del otro; bd recomienda conservar el de %2$@ y ejecutar bd bootstrap en un clon nuevo. Beady no elegirá por ti."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les beads d'ici et ceux de %1$@ ont été créés séparément ; bd ne peut donc pas les fusionner. Les réunir revient à en choisir un et à y reporter à la main les beads de l'autre ; bd conseille de garder celui de %2$@ et d'exécuter bd bootstrap dans un nouveau clone. Beady ne choisira pas pour vous."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ここのビーズと%1$@のビーズは別々に作成されたため、bdはマージできません。1つにまとめるには、どちらかを選び、もう一方のビーズを手作業で移す必要があります。bdは、%2$@のものを残し、新しいクローンでbd bootstrapを実行することを推奨しています。Beadyが代わりに選ぶことはありません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "여기의 비즈와 %1$@의 비즈는 따로 시작되었기 때문에 bd가 병합할 수 없습니다. 하나로 합치려면 한쪽을 선택하고 다른 쪽의 비즈를 직접 옮겨야 합니다. bd는 %2$@의 것을 유지하고 새 클론에서 bd bootstrap을 실행하라고 안내합니다. Beady가 대신 선택하지는 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Os beads daqui e os de %1$@ foram iniciados separadamente, então o bd não consegue mesclá-los. Juntá-los significa escolher um e mover para ele, à mão, os beads do outro; a orientação do bd é manter o de %2$@ e executar bd bootstrap em um clone novo. O Beady não vai escolher por você."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The checks changed since this was proposed, because the data was refreshed. Review them, then apply again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Prüfungen haben sich seit dem Vorschlag geändert, weil die Daten aktualisiert wurden. Sieh sie durch und wende dann erneut an."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las comprobaciones cambiaron desde que se propuso esto, porque los datos se actualizaron. Revísalas y vuelve a aplicar."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les vérifications ont changé depuis la proposition, car les données ont été actualisées. Passez-les en revue, puis appliquez à nouveau."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "データが更新されたため、提案時からチェック内容が変わりました。確認してから、もう一度適用してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "데이터가 새로 고침되어 제안 당시와 검사 결과가 달라졌습니다. 검토한 다음 다시 적용하세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "As verificações mudaram desde que isso foi proposto, porque os dados foram atualizados. Revise-as e aplique de novo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
