    "Version %@, as %@. Everyone sharing a database should run the same version; bd refuses to mix them." : {
      "comment" : "bd's version, then the role: maintainer or contributor",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Version %1$@, als %2$@. Alle, die eine Datenbank teilen, sollten dieselbe Version verwenden; bd weigert sich, sie zu mischen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Version %1$@, as %2$@. Everyone sharing a database should run the same version; bd refuses to mix them."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Versión %1$@, como %2$@. Todos los que comparten una base de datos deberían usar la misma versión; bd se niega a mezclarlas."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Version %1$@, en tant que %2$@. Toutes les personnes partageant une base de données devraient utiliser la même version ; bd refuse de les mélanger."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "バージョン%1$@（役割：%2$@）。データベースを共有する全員が同じバージョンを使う必要があります。bdは異なるバージョンの混在を拒否します。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "버전 %1$@, 역할: %2$@. 데이터베이스를 공유하는 모두가 같은 버전을 써야 합니다. bd는 버전이 섞이는 것을 거부합니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Versão %1$@, como %2$@. Todos que compartilham um banco de dados devem usar a mesma versão; o bd se recusa a misturá-las."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %@. Everyone sharing a database should run the same version; bd refuses to mix them." : {
